{
  "name": "Sirrith Ash-Tongue",
  "race": "Halfling (Athasian)",
  "class": "Defiler Wizard",
  "alignment": "neutral evil",
  "armor_class": 15,
  "hit_points": 91,
  "speed": 25,
  "abilities": [
    {
      "name": "Athasian Resilience",
      "desc": "Sirrith has advantage on saving throws against extreme heat, exhaustion, and poison."
    },
    {
      "name": "Defiler's Thirst (Overcharge Fuel)",
      "desc": "Whenever Sirrith casts an evocation or necromancy spell of 1st level or higher, she can choose to defile the surrounding life force. When she does so, a 10-foot-radius circle centered on her turns to lifeless, gray ash until cleared.\n* **Minion Harvest:** Sirrith can target a friendly halfling minion within 30 feet that she can see. The minion is instantly reduced to 0 hit points and crumbles to ash. Sirrith gains 2 Defile Charges.\n* **Juvenile Harvest:** If Sirrith targets a captive juvenile non-combatant, the captive dies instantly, granting Sirrith 3 Defile Charges.\n* **Crown Ward Backfire:** If Sirrith attempts to harvest Lira, the Verdant Crown flares with preserver backlash. The harvest fails, deals no damage to Lira, and Sirrith must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or be stunned until the end of her next turn."
    },
    {
      "name": "Overcharge Spending",
      "desc": "When casting a spell, Sirrith can spend her accumulated Defile Charges to enhance it:\n* **Empowered Ruin (1 Charge):** Reroll up to four damage dice for the spell. She must use the new rolls.\n* **Withered Reach (1 Charge):** The spell's area of effect increases by 10 feet.\n* **Necrotic Infusion (2 Charges):** All damage dealt by the spell becomes necrotic damage, and targets hit cannot regain hit points until the start of Sirrith's next turn."
    },
    {
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "desc": "Sirrith is a 9th-level spellcaster. Her spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 15, +7 to hit with spell attacks). She has the following wizard spells prepared:\n* Cantrips (at will): _chill touch_, _fire bolt_ (burning ash), _mage hand_, _sandblast_ (+7 to hit, 2d8 bludgeoning)\n* 1st level (4 slots): _mage armor_, _magic missile_, _shield_, _ray of sickness_\n* 2nd level (3 slots): _misty step_, _ray of enfeeblement_, _scorching ray_\n* 3rd level (3 slots): _counterspell_, _fireball_ (burning cinder blast), _vampiric touch_\n* 4th level (3 slots): _blight_, _dimension door_\n* 5th level (1 slot): _cone of cold_ (bone-chill flaying wind)"
    }
  ],
  "skills": [
    {
      "name": "arcana",
      "stat": "int"
    },
