    {
      "name": "Ash Shield",
      "desc": "When hit by a weapon attack, Sirrith can spend 1 Defile Charge or expend a 1st-level spell slot to cause a burst of stinging ash to swirl around her, adding +4 to her AC against that attack and imposing disadvantage on subsequent attack rolls against her until the start of her next turn."
