    },
    {
      "name": "Sacrificial Command (Costs 2 Actions)",
      "desc": "Sirrith commands one allied minion within 30 feet to immediately move up to its speed and make one melee attack, or Sirrith uses her Defiler's Thirst to harvest a willing minion within range."
